-3a045851d2c2.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk43/seasons/d4f31e2c-0b70-42d2-9ca9-f0a8f77a6175.jpg","likes":33,"dislikes":0,"views":5210,"release_date":"1483315200000","season_number":1,"description":"Bai Pingting (Angela baby) was a maid in Yan princess's residence, she was brought up unlike ordinary housemaid but like the lady of the house. Bai Pingting made friend with the son of the princess young master Hexia, when they grown up with her intelligence she often helped Hexia the young general fighting wars and won especially when he fought Jin's army led by the god of war Chu Beijie (Wallace Chung) defeating 100.000 men with only 8000 soldiers. Upon meeting Bai Pingting when she was hurt and unconscious Chu Beijie found his old hair-pin wore by her a token from his dead mother recognizing her as his childhood sweetheart, from then on Chu Beijie always after Bai Pingting with married in mind which she definitely refuse since they were an enemy and also her young master Hexia fell in love with her. Seeing Chu Beijie's restless effort to be with her and his sincerity even though Bai Pingting using her cunning ways to scare the guy she was feeling touched and loved at the same time swore to be with this god of war even though it means that she had to make enemy with her former cruel master HeXia. Hexia married Bailan's princess to gain power since he was outcast in his own country and her parents were killed, his vengeance started in a slow way, the hatred toward Chu Beijie and the ambition to have Bai Pingting consuming him giving no other thought for others. Still Bai Pingting was a brilliant war strategist her choices of tactic helping herself and Chu Beijie to get out from Hexia's clutch.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.7}],"value":6.7,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":2786,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}